// # Devin Repro 15: Operator precedence
//
// Logline: Evaluates mixed bitwise, shift, additive, and logical operators.
//
// Setup: Test 1 << 1 + 1, true || false && false, 3 | 4 ^ 5.
//
// Beats:
//   1. 1 << 1 + 1 == 4.
//   2. true || false && false == true.
//   3. 3 | 4 ^ 5 == 3.

pub fn main() {
    println(1 << 1 + 1);
    println(true || false && false);
    println(3 | 4 ^ 5);
}
